==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage, but it could be considered difficult for people who are very early into the game, so try to get at least midway through [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 before attempting this stage.

